# Prod does NOT use terraform.tfvars.
# Inputs come from GitHub Environment `prod` (domain-named secrets/vars).
# The tofu workflow maps them to TF_VAR_* — see ../../../docs/secrets.md.
#
# Do not commit terraform.tfvars for production.
# Do not tofu apply prod from a laptop.
#
# Examples of GH names (not TF_VAR_*):
#   secrets: TF_STATE_PASSPHRASE (→ TF_VAR_state_passphrase), NEON_ORG_ID, DEPLOY_SSH_PUBLIC_KEY, S3_ACCESS_KEY, HCLOUD_TOKEN, …
#   vars:    S3_ENDPOINT, S3_BUCKET, DOMAIN, APP_SERVERS (default 2), NEON_SUSPEND_TIMEOUT_SECONDS,
#            SSH_ALLOWED_CIDRS (JSON list for TCP/22), …
